  "visualReview": {
    "status": "reviewed",
    "checks": [
      "All six active character sets inspected for anime-first 2.5D style, identity consistency, anatomy and distinct framing.",
      "Infernal environments match Malebolge, the Mentira roster and Chama; no industrial technology or generic armored soldiers.",
      "Single-target frames show one ghoul; area frames show three opponents; O Intrigante's cleanse alternate shows three allies.",
      "Personal invulnerability frames show only the user.",
      "O Impostor's confession and O Intrigante's unweave alternates have standalone art; O Falsário's Liquidação panel is corrected to one target.",
      "O Incendiário's Fagulhas em Cadeia and A Brasa Eterna's Cinzas de Sufoco show exactly three ghouls.",
      "A Brasa Eterna's three suffocation-form variants have separate art; O Incendiário's area icon and A Brasa Eterna's single-target Sufoco icon have corrected sources.",
      "O Colecionador’s Galeria keeps one target; trophy echoes do not depict extra enemies.",
      "Gêmeos do Cutelo remain one playable character represented by two adult male twins with shared features and distinct silhouettes; each holds one cleaver.",
      "Gêmeos do Cutelo’s all-enemy scene shows exactly three ghouls.",
      "O Carrasco sem Rosto retains a completely blank hood; attacks show ghouls and personal defense shows only the user.",
      "A Matriarca’s Cordão Rubro shows one ghoul, Partilha da Mãe supports one ally, Berço de Sangue shows exactly three ghouls, and Casulo Rubro protects only her.",
      "Hand anatomy, weapon grips, character continuity, ability correspondence, infernal environments and varied scene framing were reviewed across the four sets."
    ]
  }
